{"slug":"kh-t-m","ar":"خ ت م","total":8,"core":"sealing","forms":[{"ar":"خَتَمَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":5,"gloss":"to seal","word":null,"ex":{"s":36,"a":65,"p":2,"ar":["ٱلْيَوْمَ","نَخْتِمُ","عَلَىٰٓ","أَفْوَٰهِهِمْ","وَتُكَلِّمُنَآ","أَيْدِيهِمْ","وَتَشْهَدُ","أَرْجُلُهُم","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَكْسِبُونَ"],"en":"That Day, We will seal over their mouths, and their hands will speak to Us, and their feet will testify about what they used to earn"}},{"ar":"مَّخْتُوم","kind":"passive participle","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"sealed","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":25,"p":4,"ar":["يُسْقَوْنَ","مِن","رَّحِيقٍ","مَّخْتُومٍ"],"en":"They will be given to drink [pure] wine [which was] sealed"}},{"ar":"خَاتَم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"seal","word":null,"ex":{"s":33,"a":40,"p":11,"ar":["مَّا","كَانَ","مُحَمَّدٌ","أَبَآ","أَحَدٍ","مِّن","رِّجَالِكُمْ","وَلَـٰكِن","رَّسُولَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَخَاتَمَ","ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ ۗ","وَكَانَ","ٱللَّهُ","بِكُلِّ","شَىْءٍ","عَلِيمًا"],"en":"Muhammad is not the father of [any] one of your men, but [he is] the Messenger of Allah and last of the prophets. And ever is Allah, of all things, Knowing"}},{"ar":"خِتَٰم","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"seal; end","word":null,"ex":{"s":83,"a":26,"p":1,"ar":["خِتَـٰمُهُۥ","مِسْكٌ ۚ","وَفِى","ذَٰلِكَ","فَلْيَتَنَافَسِ","ٱلْمُتَنَـٰفِسُونَ"],"en":"The last of it is musk. So for this let the competitors compete"}}],"surahs":[[83,2],[2,1],[6,1],[33,1],[36,1],[42,1],[45,1]]}